  "summary": "My expertise lies in Software & Cloud Application Architect with hands-on experience in software design and development in Perl, Python, C, and C++, using data structures and algorithms. I have a proven record of project execution exceeding business needs and customer expectations, and I have been recognized for developing in-depth product specifications, implementation, and deployment. I am an effective team leader and sought-after mentor, with extensive experience in team building and negotiation. \n\nAn experienced software architect, I am skilled with a wide range of programming languages and operations systems. I have more than 10 years of experience in customer on-site technology transfer programs, nationally and internationally, as well as a background in machine learning and data science methodology.  \n\nSPECIALTIES:\nSoftware Hands-on Coding; Cloud Application Architecture; Chip Design for Mobile Devices; Product Development Lifecycle Management; Machine Learning; Artificial Intelligence; Team Leadership; EDA Tools; Multiple Programming Languages; Data Science Methodology; Peer Mentoring; Communicating & Negotiating\n\nTECHNOLOGY SUMMARY:\nProgramming Languages: Perl; Python; C, C++, Java; X-Motif; GDS2; Verilog; EDIF; DEF; LEF; MATLAB; Octave; \nOperating Systems: UNIX; SUN/Solaris; Windows; Linux; AIX\nUtilities: Lex/Flex; Yacc/Bison; Make; Awk; Shell scripts; CGI scripts ; YAML\nEDA Tools: SOC-Encounter; BlastFusion; Cadence NC; Synopsis DC/Analyzer; LeonardoSpectrum; Formality; Assure\n\n",
